---
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base.astro";

const meta = {
	title: "Home",
};
---

<PageLayout meta={meta}>
	<section>
		<h1 class="title mb-2">Mahan Balooei</h1>
		<p class="text-accent mb-1 text-base font-semibold sm:text-lg">
			Computational Protein Biology · Protein Language Models · Machine Learning
		</p>
		<p class="text-muted mb-8 text-sm">MSc Bioinformatics, University of Bologna</p>

		<div class="prose prose-sm prose-cactus max-w-none">
			<p>
				I work on machine learning for proteins — protein language models, computational protein
				biology, and sequence–structure–function modelling. My recent work uses ESM-2
				representations for sequence-function prediction, alongside HMMER/MMseqs2 workflows for
				protein domain annotation, built as reproducible machine-learning pipelines. I'm interested
				in learning-based methods for protein sequence, structure, function, and molecular
				interactions.
			</p>
			<p>
				I am interested in PhD and research opportunities in protein machine learning,
				computational protein biology, and related areas.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="mt-12">
		<h2 class="title text-accent mb-4 text-lg">Research Interests</h2>
		<ul class="marker:text-accent list-disc space-y-1.5 ps-5 text-sm" role="list">
			<li>Protein language models and representation learning</li>
			<li>Protein sequence–structure–function modelling</li>
			<li>Protein–protein and protein–peptide interaction modelling</li>
			<li>Generative and structure-aware protein design</li>
			<li>Remote homology detection and functional annotation</li>
		</ul>
	</section>

	<section class="mt-12">
		<h2 class="title text-accent mb-4 text-lg">Selected Publication</h2>
		<div class="text-sm">
			<p class="font-semibold">
				Mechanism-based Targeting of Lactate Dehydrogenase Tetramerization Process through Natural
				Derived Compounds: A Survey of Molecular Docking, Molecular Dynamics, and QSAR Analysis
			</p>
			<p class="text-muted mt-1">
				<em>Computers in Biology and Medicine</em>, 2025 · Equal-contributing author
			</p>
			<p class="mt-2">
				Computational screening and molecular-dynamics analysis of LDH tetramerization interfaces.
			</p>
			<a
				class="cactus-link mt-2 inline-block font-semibold"
				href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.compbiomed.2025.111000"
				rel="noreferrer"
				target="_blank"
			>
				Paper →
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-2 text-sm">
		<a class="cactus-link" href="/research/">Research →</a>
		<a class="cactus-link" href="/publications/">Publications →</a>
		<a class="cactus-link" href="/cv/">CV →</a>
	</section>
</PageLayout>
